er\"},{\"video_id\":\"Oi-1Ev1fI74\",\"source_revision\":\"809c55ba7c740acdc6a92870492173dcd455b377ef01e85c8611305e257a2e59\",\"card_hash\":\"cdef365dba8c8b28e33c07e8d122d90e982c37b769fe0f3289830bc7c838b5fe\",\"excerpt_id\":\"9f595d903b17d10b42eca78537a8374c7ab38e25fb3b6b0c5f25c446d6671a99\",\"quote\":\"But give yourself time. If you spend a year recording the music, don't put it out in a month.\"},{\"video_id\":\"mL8umz2yvfQ\",\"source_revision\":\"7e8bd216f28d2884d7942e48730a3eec4bea72d67051768c3ab919e49d817a72\",\"card_hash\":\"5f5b568420945801e30276080c9e3f894ad5c55d1d8dccdc167f551950eb1760\",\"excerpt_id\":\"c5899c6070fb40a4790f5232e2a4c86015c1d4ea214407667f507969e1c525d2\",\"quote\":\"Pain comes in, work comes out. By the time he had a record deal, that was the only way he knew how to operate.\"},{\"video_id\":\"x_811cef5397c\",\"source_revision\":\"8c7a004deea85e4d4cd711ec917c5a7a5c9214cc65c768b7065a635331cc23e2\",\"card_hash\":\"7dfed919d3d265eb7946cfb61bdd80b4b16044429974d59309f89b1c5f46592d\",\"excerpt_id\":\"e2adb42681dc055c2b9c3a07099a6002c1c860eb3b08f401ac5296afe356a0c3\",\"quote\":\"My first interview with @sama, Co-Founder of @OpenAI. 0:04 How to start a startup\"}]},{\"path\":[\"AI and ML\",\"AI Industry and Market Economics\"],\"definition\":\"Business, financial, and market coverage of the AI industry, including company revenue, compute costs, hardware market positioning, investment, and talent demand.\",\"include\":[\"AI company revenue/ARR figures and financial comparisons between AI labs\",\"cloud and compute cost economics for running AI at scale\",\"AI hardware makers' market positioning and stock/investor reaction\",\"AI industry investment and hyperscaler spending trends\",\"AI talent market and hiring demand as an industry-wide trend\"],\"exclude\":[\"model architecture, capability benchmarks, or technical releases (see Frontier Models)\",\"personal career or job-search advice framed for an individual (see Career and Entrepreneurship)\",\"AI